WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:14.380
Sup y’all? This week we tearin sh*t
up with The Cat in the Hat by Dr. Seuss.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:21.160
Mama’s dun peaced outta da crib, and
since it’s pourin ballz outside,

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:25.460
Sally and her bro are all alone wit nuthin to do. BOOOOORING.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:30.180
Then, BUMP BUMP. “Man who da f*ck
knockin at my– OH SH*T!”

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:34.220
Well I’ll be damned, it’s a cat
rockin a big-ass hat. Dat cat like

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:37.460
“Listen up churrin, it’s time for a HOUSE
PARTY!"

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:40.680
“HOLD UP– there won’t be no cats ragin
up in dis HOUSE”

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:45.320
“Psh hop off my nuts fish. I’m a stack
you like I stack change, b*tch!"

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:50.000
Da Cat keep goin hard, tearin shit up, while
dat fish just won’t stop hatin.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.960
Then, da Cat whip out a giant red box with two hoods
stuffed inside named Thang 1 and Thang 2.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:01:01.720
Deez blue-haired bruthas take it next level when they fly kites in da house and mess wit mama’s threadz when–

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:05.379
"Oh, sh*t! Break yourselve’s fool! Mama comin home!"

00:01:05.379 --> 00:01:10.299
“Don’t trip, fish-daddy” say the Cat.
“I got a swag ride dat pick up errything real quick

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:14.500
like nuthin eva happened.”
kling klang kling klang. Hell yeah!

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:17.900
When mama come home, errything all
tidy like it was befo.

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:22.580
She ask: “What y’all lil’ shits do today?” 
Hmm. What would you say?

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:31.520
Now Dr. Seuss was bout as legit a doctor as Dre. 
Matta fact, Seuss ain’t even his real name.

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:33.000
It’s Theodore Geisel.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.220
And according to some of his homies,  dis bruh wasn’t too different from da Cat in the Hat.

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:41.820
Just like da Cat who always tossin
shit round, ragin hardcore, and makin a damn mess,

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:45.280
Geisel was sick and tired of society 
tryna keep everyone in line

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:47.480
and actin like a bunch of tight-ass scrubs.

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:52.740
I mean da Cat pretty much cruise up on dat spot wit one hand in the air and one on his nuts sayin:

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:54.960
“Rules are for b*tches. Do yo own thang.”

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:57.440
And the most subversive part 
of this thang is the ending:

00:01:57.440 --> 00:01:59.860
"Should we tell her about it?
Now, what we do?

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:02.400
Well... 
What would you do
If your mother asked you?"

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:05.500
Look at this shit– the narrator
actin like there’s a difference between

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:10.460
what he SHOULD do and what he GONNA do. 
You just know these kids bout to lie they asses off.

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:14.540
Don’t even front, man. If you were
a little kid, you’d do the same damn thing.

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:19.560
Dat playa-hatin fish reppin da part of society dat always wanna keep you on the straight and narrow.

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:22.080
Some even say he connected to Puritan morality.

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:26.120
Others say that’s da whole reason he is a fish:
cuz he lookin like dat Christian symbol

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:28.760
you see on da back of hoopties all da time.

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:33.640
And dat ain’t da only Christian symbol up in here, playboy. Afta da Cat drop in at da crib,

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:38.120
he start stackin’ some shit and balancing it like a G:
a fish, a cup, a book...

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:42.579
I could go on playa. If you keepin
it straight gangsta, you might see deez objects

00:02:42.579 --> 00:02:48.799
as religious symbols. Da fish = Christ, da
cup = the Holy Grail, and da book representin da Bible.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:52.700
He keeps stackin and stackin but
eventually it all hit the flo.

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:58.160
Maybe it symbolizin dat society gonna fall to shit
if we keep tryin to keep things too tied up.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:02.820
Or maybe it tryna tell us dat erry once in
a while, we gotta forget da rules, get a little crunk,

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:08.040
and let dat beastly side RAGE. Cuz
if we don’t, then shit really gonna fall apart.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.280
Naw I’m sayin?

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:13.920
I hope you learned something today, young bloods. I wanna know what you guys think about this episode.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:18.660
If you wanna see mo stuff like this, click on dat nasty-ass green eggs and ham.

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:21.500
